      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Steve,\n\nThe data Ctags will be received in update_flow_table() method. We didn\u0027t change any hting in voltha to work this. Below is the uplink flow details which comes to onu adapter during data flow addition.\n\ncookie: 35465848984017485\nmatch {\n  type: OFPMT_OXM\n  oxm_fields {\n    oxm_class: OFPXMC_OPENFLOW_BASIC\n    ofb_field {\n      port: 21\n    }\n  }\n  oxm_fields {\n    oxm_class: OFPXMC_OPENFLOW_BASIC\n    ofb_field {\n      type: OFPXMT_OFB_VLAN_VID\n      vlan_vid: 4096\n    }\n  }\n}\ninstructions {\n  type: 4\n  actions {\n    actions {\n      type: OFPAT_SET_FIELD\n      set_field {\n        field {\n          oxm_class: OFPXMC_OPENFLOW_BASIC\n          ofb_field {\n            type: OFPXMT_OFB_VLAN_VID\n            vlan_vid: 4218\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    actions {\n      output {\n        port: 100\n        max_len: 65509\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nid: 2689512648926098029\n, event: bulk-flow-update, instance_id: 1_1505931350, vcore_id: 0001}\n20170920T112244.588 INFO     MainThread broadcom_onu.update_flow_table {device_id: 000112b1282cafe2, event: upstream-flow, instance_id: 1_1505931350, vcore_id: 0001}\n20170920T112244.588 INFO     MainThread broadcom_onu.update_flow_table {device_id: 000112b1282cafe2, out_port: 100, event: out-port, instance_id: 1_1505931350, vcore_id: 0001}\n20170920T112244.589 INFO     MainThread broadcom_onu.update_flow_table {device_id: 000112b1282cafe2, in_port: 21, event: field-type-in-port, instance_id: 1_1505931350, vcore_id: 0001}\n20170920T112244.589 INFO     MainThread broadcom_onu.update_flow_table {device_id: 000112b1282cafe2, vlan: 0, event: field-type-vlan-vid, instance_id: 1_1505931350, vcore_id: 0001}\n20170920T112244.589 INFO     MainThread broadcom_onu.update_flow_table {device_id: 000112b1282cafe2, field: type: OFPXMT_OFB_VLAN_VID\nvlan_vid: 4218\n, in_port: 21, event: action-type-set-field, instance_id: 1_1505931350, vcore_id: 0001}\n20170920T112244.590 INFO  